{"version":1,"content":"<p>《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》將於2027年1月1日晚上7時，假亞洲國際博覽館ARENA舉行。</p><p>今日公布「叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的男歌手、女歌手及組合」第一階段正式完結，10強誕生。</p><p>當中古天樂與宣萱繼續強勢留低。</p><p>「叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的男歌手」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.312221+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.645415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.645415+00:00","content_hash":"b27e36f0b03979a3cec5450507e557659772c31faffd69ecd6b238edc694d028","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}